Z||000005||Turbo88||12-06-2001||09:25 PM||||I never counted the splines on the RAM when I put it in. I was in the hopes of putting in the 60* V6 fbody clutch in it. Just an idea I was toying with. I've made my racing budget to allow a new transaxle every year. Why? Don't know enough about their longevity. They are cheap enough for sure. The scrap yard peice I have now cost 125 smackers and is holding up fine! It's that whole Murphy's Law thing. If I plan on replacing it, maybe I won't have too!!!!! *Starts the wishful thinking*<BR>||||reg||1
